    "en": {
      "trackName": "Retro Arcade for Watch",
      "description": "Retro Arcade is a FREE collection of classic arcade games on your wrist and on your phone!\n\nIncludes the following games:\n• Kepler Attack - featured in Apple's \"Great on watchOS 6\" and \"Our Favourite Apple Watch Apps\" collections!\n• Asteroid Commando - Touch Arcade's Game of the Week!\n• Tank Commando - drive a tank, rescue downed WWII pilots.\n• Red Baron 1917 - battle fleets of enemy planes in this WWI shooter.\n• Assault Jet - a brand new shooter set above a city as you battle UFOs.\n• Area 51 - an experimental 3D game for the Watch. This is not a full game, but something we are exploring!\n\nNOTE: If you own any of the paid versions of these games, make sure they are installed on your iPhone when launching Retro Arcade and they will unlock so you have unlimited play. Thank you for supporting us!\n\nFeaturing:\n• Beautiful retro arcade graphics!\n• Power-ups include Shield, Triple Shot, Rapid Fire and Smart Bomb!\n• Intuitive and simple controls using the Crown on the Watch!\n• Swipe to move on the iPhone!\n• Compete against the world with Game Center leaderboards!\n• Short burst gameplay is perfect for the Watch and iPhone!\n• Play anywhere, anytime!\n• Play for free using in game Credits.\n• Or buy the games outright using IAP.\n\nNOTE: Owners of the existing paid games will be able to play unlimited games for FREE! Just make sure the existing paid game is installed on your iPhone when launching Retro Arcade.\n\nRelive the glory days of the arcade on your Apple Watch and iPhone.\n\nThanks for playing\nJohnno & Pete",
      "releaseNotes": "Introducing a new game, Tank Commando!\n- Added a Pause screen to allow quick exiting of Watch games\n\nEnjoy,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/retro-arcade-for-watch/id1667674066?uo=4",
