    {
      "version": "2023.3",
      "releaseNotes": "- Added the game name to the game button\n- Added a \"Share the Love\" button with a QR code to make sharing the game with friends easy\n\nThanks for playing,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2023-01-30T21:18:56Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2023.4",
      "releaseNotes": "* Added Game Center support on iPhone!\n* NOTE: Your Watch scores will save to Game Center when you open the app on the iPhone\n* Tap the new Trophy button to see how you compare against players from all around the world\n* Updated the UI on \"Settings\" and \"Share the Love\" screens so back button is always visible\n* Updated the icon\n\nLet us know what games you would like to see next!\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2023-02-05T17:18:54Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2023.5",
      "releaseNotes": "* Added the ability to buy each game outright to play without using credits\n\nPreviously\n* Added Game Center support on iPhone!\n* NOTE: Your Watch scores will save to Game Center when you open the app on the iPhone\n* Tap the new Trophy button to see how you compare against players from all around the world\n* Updated the UI on \"Settings\" and \"Share the Love\" screens so back button is always visible\n* Updated the icon\n\nLet us know what games you would like to see next!\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2023-02-11T13:31:35Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2023.6",
      "releaseNotes": "For players who own the the paid versions of Kepler Attack, Jupiter Attack, Asteroid Commando or Red Baron 1917 this update unlocks those games in this collection!\n- Simply make sure any of these games are installed on your iOS device when you launch Retro Arcade and they will be unlocked (and have a heart badge) \n- Now you can play them without using Credits!\n\nThanks so much for your support,\nJohnno and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2023-03-12T15:32:25Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2023.7",
      "releaseNotes": "For players who own the the paid versions of Kepler Attack, Jupiter Attack, Asteroid Commando or Red Baron 1917 this update unlocks those games in this collection!\n- Simply make sure any of these games are installed on your iOS device when you launch Retro Arcade and they will be unlocked (and have a heart badge) \n- Now you can play them without using Credits!\n- NOTE: Jupiter Attack will be unlocked as Assault Jet\n- Fixed a bug where all games were shown as unlocked\n\nThanks so much for your support,\nJohnno and Pete\n",
      "seenAt": "2023-03-13T23:35:08Z"
    },
    {
      "version": "2023.8",
      "releaseNotes": "Introducing a new experimental game, Area 51.\n\nThis is our first 3D game, and it's an MVP (minimal viable product) meaning it's fairly bare bones as we aren't sure if folks would like 3D. So if you do like it and want to see more let us know at support@redspritestudios.com\n\nCheers,\nJohn and Pete",
      "seenAt": "2023-05-21T06:50:17Z"
    },
    {
